Trust boundary: repository owner/account, stable source/runtime files and original authority storage are trusted. No OS isolation, remote attestation, merge/release authority or global semantic admission is claimed. Existing keys/authority instances and all historical failed stages/attempts/consumptions remain intact. No operation is rerun in an existing acquisition namespace.
